; Unsigned on purpose: 43a's IXFR question is about deltas, and a signed zone
; serves file_serial + hours-since-epoch (zone_signer::signed_serial), which
; makes "did the serial move by one" a different question. 43d rewrites this
; zone over UPDATE.
$ORIGIN example.org.
$TTL 3600
@       IN SOA ns1.example.org. hostmaster.example.org. ( 2026091101 3600 600 604800 300 )
@       IN NS  ns1.example.org.
@       IN NS  ns2.example.org.
ns1     IN A   192.0.2.2
ns2     IN A   192.0.2.3
www     IN A   192.0.2.10
mail    IN A   192.0.2.25
